  "description": "Read firearm and ammunition product titles in Umbraco: brand, model (e.g. \"Glock 19 Gen 5 MOS\"), caliber, magazine capacity, barrel length, rounds per box and cost per round. A property value converter turns the text box properties you choose into parsed results for Razor views, ModelsBuilder and the Delivery API, and an HTML helper renders a spec list. Built on the GunsNPrices title parser (https://gunsnprices.com). Umbraco 17 and 18.",
